  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>33033</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>11</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>273</mn></math></p><p>On comparing both sides of the equation we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>273</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>272</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>17</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>44</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>176</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>231</mn></math>.</p><p>Therefore, the required value is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>231</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
